{"aliases":["S15","4Kpsuq0K","4a9ca56dc11f0dc7168a5d16a19df641913f05b8c7cfc31f6805c352f23ad830"],"scope":"重复处理 S01 的同一 URL 与同一 MP4 SHA-256；登记在再采集前但首次内容暴露之后，不能当独立事前来源测试或新增支持样本。","state":"duplicate_not_independent","text":"## Source check S15: DOGE claimed breakout-retest and new-entry timing

**Registered before this acquisition but not before first content exposure:** The frozen Ronnie_Dong TradingView archive at Git `0725a7b3f89902e27cd421a18b4b879a13268534` identifies `4Kpsuq0K`, created 2024-10-28 09:23:27.545737 UTC, 550 seconds, original media `https://video-ideas.tradingview.com/1/1416280-Bf_rqWB7C_1tcMiE.mp4`. The registration at `c2123e65204ed5122a0ba5728ed7a4fadb7649f8` asked whether DOGE shows a completed outer break/retest and contemporaneous new entry with invalidation (H07), or a retest of the same trend line and new order (H06a). It incorrectly described this as a *distinct* original: S01 had already parsed and discussed this exact URL and the DOGE 06:05-06:50 segment. The two acquired MP4 files have identical SHA-256 `4a9ca56dc11f0dc7168a5d16a19df641913f05b8c7cfc31f6805c352f23ad830`. This is a duplicate source-processing attempt, not an independent prospective source test; the original registration and the correction both remain visible.

**Read and decision:** The new fast note is `/Users/vx/.local/share/bilibili-note-mcp/notes/note-eb1692755e4e4bcb9f573d4f4eeaba38/note.md` (SHA-256 `7b1ff268c0d325e0018838dfbfb9700ec5fa56b86bcc164ad1939ac0c9ffabbe`); the prior S01 note is `/Users/vx/.local/share/bilibili-note-mcp/notes/note-00e13dbc423b4fdea073b515bff98c6e/note.md` (SHA-256 `bba9495107393bee833e9004c643a85c3136888cf93249a57987a0ffcaeb9c2b`). The new DOGE speech at 06:05-06:13 calls the **past** pullback to Fibonacci 38.2% and a previous high standard. At 06:22-06:43 he lists **alternative future** paths: short at the high, chase a future break, enter long after a future break/retest, or wait for lower horizontal support. Original frames around 06:11 and 06:49 show the chart and prospective arrows, not a new order on the already observed pullback. No unique new-entry/stop/target triplet is given. H07's and H06a's strict positive-entry gates remain unmet; S15 adds no independent confirmation to S01. The exact acquisition, media identity, segment and frame references are in `results/2026-10-08-s15-duplicate-source.json`. Do not run a new annual candidate on this duplicate or count it as a second video in source support.","title":"Source check S15: DOGE claimed breakout-retest and new-entry timing"}
